Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.91,Hook,,0,0,0,,¡ES UN CÍRCULO DE\NRITUAL SATÁNICO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Eso es un círculo de\Nritual satánico!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.34,0:00:04.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Y quién va a ser… yo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:06.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Yo soy el sacrificio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:09.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}«El sacrificio del siervo\Nsagrado».
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Y listo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:13.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Genial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:15.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Mira estos símbolos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:17.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oh, hermano.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:19.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me tragó el suelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:24.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}«Estoy en casa. ¿Cariño?\N¿Dónde estás?»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, me tragó la tele,\Ngüey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me tragó la tele.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Susy… hola. Verga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Fin.
